OL,3,GNEWSAMake a Difference Awards 2026
OL,4,Ahonour their winners
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who worked his way back to
OL,7,Fwalking again after being told he never
OL,8,Fwould again was among the winners at
OL,9,FBBC Radio Stoke's Make A Difference
OL,10,FAwards with other winners including a
OL,11,Fman who battled his addiction and now
OL,12,Fhelps others.
OL,14,FThe ceremony was held at the Bet365
OL,15,FStadium on Thursday, where the stories
OL,16,Fof all those shortlisted were shared
OL,17,Fwith guests.
