OL,3,GNEWSAMake a Difference Awards 2026
OL,4,Ahonour their winners
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther winners on the night included a
OL,7,Fgroup that had planted more than 300
OL,8,Ftrees and a former Michelin starred
OL,9,Fchef who raised more than #170,000 for
OL,10,Fthree charities.
OL,12,FThere were a total of 32 finalists this
OL,13,Fyear across eight categories.
